{"reviewId": "380041367_85RljIfWr", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "康波：像冬去春来、春去夏来的长季节变化（长期冷/热）\n\n库兹涅茨：像每年固定出现的梅雨季/雨季（中期规律）\n\n朱格拉：像今天下雨、明天放晴（短期波动）", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "(1)每个康波是指一个相当长时期总的价格的上升或总的价格的下降。(2)价格的长期波动不是自己产生的，而康德拉季耶夫认为是资本主义体系本质的结果。(3)每个康波又嵌套着几个库兹涅茨周期和几个朱格拉周期。", "range": "3423-3523", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "380041367_85RljIfWr", "userVid": 380041367, "topics": [], "createTime": 1767358860, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 380041367, "name": "GR", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0031-P6hqbJRljynfKT9e8iT1yc1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "GR", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240520-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 282, "likes": [{"userVid": 258270628, "name": "喊·山", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/feBMdkKpPNdicPicEc7VZ8EUBfkGVfWn6ral31JSToC3DiaA5CRWkkG2BZ5iciaqnjicWmydYKyoven7qA963KS4zgAWKra0kezwGA41Ymu60neNU/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241125-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 7, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "还有个基钦周期", "reviewId": "380041367_85RljIfWr", "commentId": "380041367_85RljIfWr_c222645780_8bm8jNR